Authors and copyright holders of the code in the dseams source package

The R glue, configure scripts and tools are by the package authors in
DESCRIPTION. The rest of src/ is copied from other projects by
tools/vendor.sh and tools/vendor-readers.sh. Each part keeps its licence;
LICENSE.note gives the licence of every part and where its text is in
the source package.


