rustc also links its own copies of crates section 3 already names.
The licence and the authors are the ones in that section. The versions
in rustc 1.100.0 are adler2 2.0.1, cfg-if 1.0.4 (the vendor tree has
1.0.5), libc 0.2.189 (the vendor tree has 0.2.191), memchr 2.8.3, and
miniz_oxide 0.9.1. cfg-if 1.0.4's MIT notice is Copyright 2014 Alex
Crichton, the same notice as the vendored 1.0.5 text. libc 0.2.189's
MIT notice names The Rust Project Developers, as the vendored text does.


